Test_ophost</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opapi</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_kernel</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/2938/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-19 17:44:52] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-19T17:36:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T17:44:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165775279,"discussion_id":"37db3024b4c7f7c7b47775699863dcea9a366f88","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了`repeat_interleave_grad`算子反向传播计算中的一个边界条件缺陷。原实现中，当重复因子`r`为0时，算子未对输出梯度进行显式初始化，可能导致输出梯度数据未定义（包含脏数据），从而影响模型训练的正确性。本次修改旨在完善算子的鲁棒性，确保在`r=0`时能输出正确的零梯度。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改在`RepeatInterleaveGradDimNOneDavid`类中实现。核心是在`ProcessRepeatBlock`函数中新增了对`r == 0`的特殊处理分支。该分支会调用新增的`ProcessZeroR`函数，该函数使用值为0.0的常量`INIT_FLOAT_VALUE`，通过`Duplicate`操作将计算缓冲区初始化为0，再通过`CopyOut`将结果写回全局内存的输出位置，并正确同步`MTE3_V`事件以保证数据一致性，从而确保对应输出梯度区域被正确填充为0。","created_at":"2026-03-19T17:38:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T17:38:43+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165815884,"discussion_id":"4332ff742fa496fec1987a74d3a67c8a257699d3","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-19T22:01:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T22:01:35+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165833971,"discussion_id":"1832ecd8f109b2fdacbfc3ba24660dfb3f7aec2e","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-20T09:28:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-20T09:28:25+08:00","user":{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","object_id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165833994,"discussion_id":"0de6cba432efcfbc609081508fbc7d2d2841f9b9","body":"### Review Guide\n\n This pull-request **passes review**.\n Committers who wrote a comment of `/approve` are: [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong).\nReviewers who wrote a comment of `/lgtm` are: [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317).\n","created_at":"2026-03-20T09:28:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-20T09:28:34+0